<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/aDi-4/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "अधि /adhi/ 1. adv. наверх, сверху 2. praep. 1) на (Acc. ) 2) от, из (Abl. ) 3) в, в отношении (Loc. )"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/aDi-4/dict/kna/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "अधि\t/adhi/\t\t/адхи/\tadhi adv. на верху, вверхъ; adhy adhi какъ можно выше; — praep. и postpos. c. abl. отъ, изъ.\tс. 195"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "kna" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/aDi-4/dict/fri/3> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "adhi adv.; наверху, над этим, вверх, кроме того"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "fri" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/aDi-4/dict/fri/4> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "+prep. + acc., lok.; над, через, на, в, ввиду, к, против"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
